  "admitted_implementation_scope": [
    "Only two owned generate_clothline.rs/flag_connections.rs sources; actual global ClothInfo Vec and same DecoratorVisualState nested transient owner, actual10 SystemParam resources/LocalCache/Commands/Sound writer, no alternate state/resource/component/world.",
    "Private semantic cache/connection plans and indexed graph API are current engineering representations, not raw nativeABI or invented CandidateInfo layout. Empty Default only proven original cache containers.",
    "Real input projection and stable unsignedID sorted index/per-source ordered neighbors; duplicateID graph identity stays indexed, degrees/edges map via permutation. Actual RaycastWorld finite distance-0.01/mask30db after slope/distance guards. No global all-edge greedy sort, fake alwaysclear production ray or ID-key degree collapse.",
    "Native previousID/pair cache and soundkind16/context0 order before geometry/asset failure preserved; current firstVec/persistent maps not silently cleared or replaced.",
    "Real signed endpoint terms/tie order and optional storage scalar only through actual Wall bucket+ID, without foreign Storage change/d2s assumption. No whole-record default.",
    "Actual endpoint, garment and None-style thread Commands use already integrated canonical builder/payload/NormalMap and real named asset owners, same transient lifetime. No discardedquad/fakeVAO/synthesizedasset/type stand-in."
  ],
  "implementation_requirements": [
    "Keep explicit native f32 accumulation/signedzero/NaN expression order; fixed negativeaxis(-1,-0,-0), zero products and original maxss/minss semantics may not be replaced by Vec3::lerp/NEG_X/normalize_or or generic finiteclamp. Bind each nonfinite-sensitive helper to the exact operands.",
    "Preserve unsigned saturating floatcasts and subsequent explicit wrapping count arithmetic; no artificial cap for allocation/RNG work. Shared random_splits owns its real reserve/assert/draw order. Perplan initialized RNG and exactly onefullu32+twof32 draws per garment.",
    "Preserve garment roundf/.7 and interval multiplier bits0x3f36db6e, versus thread ceilf/.3; per-component weightedproducts/subtractions/sag and actual quaternion dependency. No reassociation or copied dependency algorithms.",
    "Graph filtering/sort must preserve original source nonzero/target==1, strict/unordered gates and partial_cmp.unwrap semantics. Separate unrecovered flag caller may adapt returned indices but cannot fabricate payload or route Some-style through Noneonly helper.",
    "Strict true texture name->AssetIndex->DescriptorIndex and Namedmesh resolution remain observable failures. Installed sibling normal files alone do not establish hashmapping/release-equivalent assets.",
    "Freeze full before/candidate/patch and all actualdependencies including integrated Cloth3source and finiteworld919b; no stalecore rlib/source replacement."
  ],
  "required_bounded_tests": [
    "Actual repeated sameWorld system with nonempty canonicalClothInfo/Commands/same transient; duplicateIDs/stableties/per-sourceweights, nativephysicsocclusion finite before/beyond.",
    "Initial/unchanged/removed/reintroduced node/paircache sounds; explicit Wall bucket with absent d2s; exact nonzero garment3words/NormalMap and actualendpoint/thread components; missing/shifted assetindex must not be hidden.",
    "Signedzero/nonfinite expression cases and RNG/count boundary cases. Pure helper callback allowed only test, not production; recordedCPUflush cannot count as GPU/loader acceptance."
  ],
  "unclosed_domains": [
    "Upstream twoWindow BoxClothInfo writers; general flag placement/style domain/Some-style thread.",
    "Actual fullvisual ordering/registration beforeNani44 and transientdespawn/unload host; no wholeplugin install permitted solely from this design.",
    "Real assets load/upload, currentfullcrate typecheck, actualApp/nonemptyworld/WSI/pixels/performance."
